# Build outputs
# IMPORTANT: dist/ files are now TRACKED in git to ensure compiled code is always available
# This provides a fallback if automatic builds fail during Docker build
# The Dockerfile still builds automatically as a secondary measure (for fresh compilation)
#
# When you modify frontend code, remember to:
# 1. npm run build
# 2. git add girder_nifti_viewer/web_client/dist/
# 3. git commit with both source and compiled changes
#
# girder_nifti_viewer/web_client/dist/*.js
# girder_nifti_viewer/web_client/dist/*.css
# girder_nifti_viewer/web_client/dist/*.map
# !girder_nifti_viewer/web_client/dist/.gitkeep

